# Full Migration Rule (No Compatibility)

When the requested change is a migration/refactor from one module/domain to another, perform a full cutover.

- Do not keep compatibility shims, proxy re-exports, dual-path runtime, or temporary wrappers.
- Remove deprecated folders/files/exports in the same task once replacements are in place.
- Update all imports and package entry exports to the new canonical location.
- Regenerate generated artifacts after path/API changes so generated code matches the new source of truth.
- Verify there are no leftover references to old paths/symbols before finishing.

## Required Validation

- Type-check affected packages/apps after migration.
- Run domain-specific runtime/debug checks for representative cases.
- If Storyblok-related foundations changed, run the required Storyblok sync command in the same task.

## Hydration Domain Expectation

For hydration/compiler migrations in this repo, use `builder-templates` as the single canonical domain and fully remove old alternatives during the same change.
